# The knowledge-base corpus lives in the Unity Catalog volume
# (/Volumes/dev/platform/automation-builder) and is uploaded there directly.
# Git was a second, silently-diverging copy: these were last committed before a
# reorganisation into *-official/ folders, so the tracked set no longer matched
# what retrieval actually reads. rag_setup.py chunks from the volume, never
# from here.
